<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Get Queue Number</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div class="logo">🏛️</div>
    <h1>Registrar<br><span>Queuing System</span></h1>
    <div class="date">Sep 19, 2025 | 10:24 AM | 👤</div>
</header>

<aside>
    <a>⌂ &nbsp; Home</a>
    <a class="active">🎟️ &nbsp; Get Queue Number</a>
    <a>⌕ &nbsp; Queue Status</a>
    <a>▣ &nbsp; Services</a>
    <a>👤 &nbsp; Profile</a>
    <a>⚙ &nbsp; Settings</a>
    <hr>
    <a>⇥ &nbsp; Log Out</a>
</aside>

<main>

    <div class="queue-box">

        <h2>🎟️ &nbsp; Get Queue Number</h2>
        <p>Select a service to get your queue number.</p>

        <div class="services">

            <button>📄 &nbsp; Request Transcript<br>of Records <b>›</b></button>

            <button>📜 &nbsp; Request Certificate <b>›</b></button>

            <button>👤 &nbsp; Enrollment /<br>Registration <b>›</b></button>

            <button>💳 &nbsp; Payment / Assessment <b>›</b></button>

            <button>📖 &nbsp; Request School<br>Records <b>›</b></button>

            <button>••• &nbsp; Other Registrar<br>Concerns <b>›</b></button>

        </div>

        <div class="buttons">
            <button class="get">🎟️ &nbsp; Get Queue Number</button>
            <button class="cancel">Cancel</button>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="preview">

        <h2>Queue Preview</h2>

        <div class="info">
            🎟️
            <span>Now Serving<br><b>A-025</b></span>
        </div>

        <div class="info">
            👥
            <span>People Waiting<br><b>12</b></span>
        </div>

        <div class="info">
            🕐
            <span>Estimated Wait<br><b>15 min</b></span>
        </div>

    </div>

</main>

</body>
</html>
